\\(S\\)</span> 为有限词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_S\\)</span> 允许无限模型，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5ea5b4fccf12f679\" href=\"?note=5ea5b4fccf12f679\" title=\"29-df-satisfiable\">29-df-satisfiable</a>；不使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSat}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSat}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq\\Phi\\;(\\operatorname{card}(\\Phi_0)&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi_0)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq\\Phi\\;(\\operatorname{card}(\\Phi_0)&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi_0)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原任意模型紧致性陈述；其支持接口现为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6d4131ca1202619d\" href=\"?note=6d4131ca1202619d\" title=\"29-thm-compactness\">29-thm-compactness</a>，不再依赖第57本书未提供的文件。有限子集条件中的 Sat 使用任意非空模型，不能替换成有限可满足性。原有限非紧致性示例不变。新目标为语境重建条目，不是已恢复的原外部文档。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"5ea5b4fccf12f679","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfiable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"6d4131ca1202619d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"5ea5b4fccf12f679","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sat}_S$ 允许无限模型，见 [[29-df-satisfiable]]；不使用 $\\mathrm{FinSat}_S$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"6d4131ca1202619d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"保留原任意模型紧致性陈述；其支持接口现为 [[29-thm-compactness]]，不再依赖第57本书未提供的文件。有限子集条件中的 Sat 使用任意非空模型，不能替换成有限可满足性。原有限非紧致性示例不变。新目标为语境重建条目，不是已恢复的原外部文档。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSat}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq\\Phi\\;(\\operatorname{card}(\\Phi_0)<\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi_0)).","display":true}],"bytes":1624,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-fo-completeness]]、[[29-thm-fo-compactness]] — 完备性与紧致性"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-fo-compactness]]"}],"outgoing":["5ea5b4fccf12f679","711217f22972ffc0","6d4131ca1202619d"]}